-/**
- * Render a cue into a normalized Float32 mono buffer, mixed with optional noise.
- * tone: {wave, freqStart, freqEnd, amp, attack, decay, total} or array for stacked partials
- * noiseCtx: {amp, attack, decay, total, hp?}
